# C++ program to find the sum of all the elements of the given array

Write a C++ program to find the sum of all the elements of the given array.

Solution: 

```c++
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;
int main() {
    int n;
    cin >> n;
    int arr[n];
    int sum = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        cin >> arr[i];
        sum += arr[i];
    }
    cout << "The sum of all the elements of the given array is: " << sum << endl;
    return 0;
}
```

